OL,3,GNEWSAEU food check cut risks health and
OL,4,Ajobs - council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government says the agreement - due
OL,7,Fto be finalised on 20 November - would
OL,8,Fboost the UK economy by #5.1bn a year
OL,9,Fand would "not compromise UK
OL,10,Fbiosecurity".
